            "review_title": "Review at Pho Nho 162",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nGood value tasty pho\nSep 2022 • Couples\nDelicious and clean. Popped in here one evening when nearby for a post gym dinner and was not disappointed. Large inside and clean with great selection of condiments on the tables. Enjoyed two pho dishes with beer, perhaps not quite as good as spicy pho closely but still tasty and good value none the less\nWritten September 13, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
