            "review_title": "Review at Pho Nho 162",
            "review_text": "Peetahluv\nSan Diego, California110 contributions\n1\nLocal, fresh and delicious\nNov 2017 • Friends\nLocals and expatriates frequent this Pho joint and you won’t be disappointed. \nThe broth is on point, deep in flavor with excellent noodle to soup ratio. I had the Pho Ba, flank steak. There is quiet a selection to choose from, including a full veggie option, including the broth. \nJust make sure you ask for the veggies to put in your soup. You don’t want to miss out on the basil, mint, bean sprouts and banana flower. \nOur meal was 70k, 20k for veggie and 30k for the flank steak.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2017",
